  "id": "expert-witness",
  "term": "expert witness",
  "definition": "An expert witness is a specialist who is hired by one side in a legal case to assess, interpret, and present professional evidence or opinions. In adversarial settings, this role can be affected by pressures and biases tied to the side that retained the expert, which may reduce impartiality.",
